## `fundere` propaga la memoria: un embed `Drop` hace `Drop` al host (move-only
## y con cleanup compuesto) y un embed `Nexus` deja el host copiable pero
## banishable. La propagación es recursiva.
rune Leaf derive Drop:
    n as int

rune Mid fundere Leaf:
    m as int

rune Top fundere Mid:
    t as int

rune Tag derive Nexus:
    label as int

rune Entry fundere Tag:
    note as int

weave main into int:
    # 1. `Drop` se propaga por dos niveles.
    var a as Top is with mid is (with leaf is (with n is 1), m is 2), t is 3
    var b as Top is calling a.clone
    set b.t is 30
    if a.t != 3 or b.t != 30:
        return 1
    if b.mid.leaf.n != 1:
        return 2
    banish b
    # 2. `Nexus` no hace `Drop` al host: se puede copiar.
    var e as Entry is with tag is (with label is 7), note is 8
    var f as Entry is e
    if f.tag.label != 7 or f.note != 8:
        return 3
    banish e
    banish f
    # 3. `Drop` en el segundo embed también cuenta.
    var c as Top is with mid is (with leaf is (with n is 4), m is 5), t is 6
    banish c
    return 0
